ankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T18:29:31-07:00","id":861490,"title":"","content":"If an answer comes, I'll post it here. Prematurely, let me attach a caveat that this might all be included later in a supplement.<br /> <br /> But if I get an answer, I'll share.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T18:31:51-07:00","id":861491,"title":"","content":"Just a thought, but if Grimms don't get Seeming Effects, then Fae Touched &amp; Changeling Grimms have no contracts that they can choose at Character Creation, making them unplayable, because the rules require 2 dots of contracts come from a Contract with a Seeming bless for your Seeming.<br /> <br /> Also this role thing, are there benifits beyond Clarity for being in a role, perhaps its the Seeming Blessing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T22:26:04-07:00","id":863024,"title":"","content":"Idle musings here, but I can see a Grimm's role being tied strongly to his Mask and Mien (or whatever Virtue/Vice analogue they're going to go with in the end). And for a non-Clarity Facet to the Blessing, perhaps a Grimm also receives a Glamour-based benefit from being &quot;in-character&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b